1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,280
[Come on, wave! This one's for Tatay Rudy!]

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:10,300
[Something for your trip, son. Don't spend it all at once.]

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,530
[Oh, Ma.]

4
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,830
[Your turn, pare.]

5
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:22,293
[How does this work? What do I press?]

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,050
[Nothing. Just don't turn it off.]

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,877
[I'll leave it here. Photo, everybody!]

8
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,420
[One, two…]

9
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:53,900
Nico, the bank called again. We're three months behind.

10
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:58,550
I know. Money's coming in. I promise.

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,689
From where? That channel of yours?

12
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:05,499
It's making money now, Liz.

13
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:13,829
Eighteen hundred. In a month. Nico… let's sell the shop. Please.

14
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:17,480
One more month.

15
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,650
Feed Bea. Bea, don't let Papa stay up late, okay?

16
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,490
Yes, Ma.

17
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,464
Pa, what's "Old Tape"?

18
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,973
Nothing. Work.

19
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,872
Pa, there's a box outside. It's getting rained on.

20
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,100
No sender.

21
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:54,460
Pa, the money looks different.

22
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,947
It's just old. The bank will still take it.

23
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:02,560
Shh. Don't tell Mama yet, okay?

24
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,880
…Okay.

25
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,840
[Outside, everyone! With the jeep!]

26
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,040
Pa.

27
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,611
Hm?

28
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:48,800
Who's that standing by the kitchen?

29
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,360
…Is that a person?

30
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,380
It's been there the whole time.

31
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,027
The whole time?

32
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,020
[One, two…]

33
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,850
[Bye, Dad!]

34
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,151
Pa… are you going to post that?

35
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:56,240
No. …I don't know.

36
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:59,113
Please don't.

37
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,080
Go to sleep, sweetheart.

38
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:23,560
Tape one. No label. No name.

39
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,341
Bea.
